#: port/app/ingame3ds.cpp:632
#, menu
msgid "Sharp keeps pixels crisp and even. Smooth blends them. CRT draws the lines and colours of a tube TV, Curved CRT its rounded glass too."
msgstr "Sharp keeps pixels crisp and even. Smooth blends them. CRT draws the lines and colors of a tube TV, Curved CRT its rounded glass too."

